ored the whole site, main site as well forum site. I will say this the main site login does not work at this time it will however once my coder is able to get it working with our forum. Also, if you need to register on the forum itself you can use the registration link on the main site, and if you lost your password that as well works, which all leads to the forum. I also redid the background of all the character sheets. Also, if you haven't please sign up on the facebook and join our group I keep everyone updated on the progress. Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10501-laura","name":"Laura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10501_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-17T12:31:48-07:00","id":892702,"title":"","content":"Hello, guys and gals, I apologise if I had not kept you updated the past week. I had no power due to storms in my area, however, I have updated the site. Also, those who signed up on the forum I do apologise again that I had to take it down so that my database guy can work on the login system to go with the wiki and the chat itself and so forth, however that forum will be ready to be used soon. Also... here is a message that you all should adhere too.<br /> <br /> Word of Warning. When accessing the Website please use Either Chrome, Opera, or Firefox. DO not, use IE. I don't use that browser at all. However, Chrome will not Support Java. But you do have other options to use to join the chat other than Java. Which is what I like about Para Chat.<br /> <br /> Thank you,<br /> Laura.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10501-laura","name":"La